name 'aif-y2-natural-language-processing-preassessment-q7-2026'

wrong 'The message itself, exactly as the sender typed it'
wrong 'A one-sentence summary of the message written by a person'
wrong 'The message with all of its punctuation and capital letters stripped out'
right 'Numbers computed from the message, such as its exclamation point count'

